ExtendedSwiftMath is an independently rewritten, standalone library. It was
originally inspired by SwiftMath (https://github.com/mgriebling/SwiftMath) by
Mike Griebling, itself a Swift translation of iosMath
(https://github.com/kostub/iosMath) by Kostub Deshmukh. That earlier work
sparked this project; this acknowledgment is provided as a courtesy.

